new_increment: review-11 passed the dynamic build-folder shell wrapper and package creation, producing 16 headers, 2 static libraries and 14 CLI binaries; exact package consumer test returned RC=0. The recipe no longer embeds a workstation task path, while the known install-helper awk diagnostics remain covered by explicit package-content checks. r009 target validation passed consumer, non-empty rigctl -l and upstream 12/12 with one launch and postrelease ABSENT.
applicability_boundary: The shell-wrapper and dynamic-directory rules apply to Windows-hosted Autotools/libtool recipes whose generated commands evaluate paths containing spaces; the explicit-copy fallback is limited to named package outputs after an install-helper capability failure and must not mask a nonzero install or substitute for target execution. Process-count readiness is valid only when the harness also exercises the expected socket path.
